===Preposition===
{{head|ru|preposition}}

# {{+obj|ru|dat|catpos=prep}}
## {{n-g|used broadly to indicate action, typically involving movement, across a surface or across several things in a generally flat plane}}; [[across]], [[on]], [[along]], [[down]], [[up]], [[all over]], ([[all around|all]]) [[around]]:
##: {{uxi|ru|[[таракан|Тарака́н]] [[бе́гал]] '''по''' [[столу́]].|The cockroach ran '''across''' the table.}}
##: {{uxi|ru|[[он|Он]] [[плыл]] '''по''' [[реке́]].|t=He swam '''down''' the river.}}
